# ElevenLabs connector MCP — per-operator config (co-located, NOT the product .env).
# Copy to `mcp/elevenlabs/.env` (gitignored) and paste the real key. Never commit the filled file.
#
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY        — API key (https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys). SECRET.
#                             Restrict its scopes to what you use (text-to-speech, voices, models, user).
# ELEVENLABS_OUTPUT_DIR     — optional. Default audio dir. Unset => <NOCTUS_PRIVATE_DIR or
#                             ~/.noctusai/private>/elevenlabs/<YYYY-MM-DD>/ (outside every git tree).
# ELEVENLABS_MAX_CHARS      — optional per-call text cap (default 5000). Safety net against runaway spend.
# ELEVENLABS_ZERO_RETENTION — optional. "true" (default) sends enable_logging=false (ElevenLabs
#                             documents this as enterprise-only); set "false" to accept retention on
#                             other tiers — a deliberate privacy decision.
# ELEVENLABS_BASE_URL       — optional. Default https://api.elevenlabs.io (data-residency hosts exist).

ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=replace-with-your-elevenlabs-api-key
